WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.418 --> 00:00:05.213
Caiman, I'm going to stay here
as En's partner.

00:00:05.964 --> 00:00:07.632
I can't go with you.

00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:11.052
What? Are you out of your mind?

00:00:12.137 --> 00:00:16.933
I know, that En guy is controlling you
with his Magic, right?

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:19.561
I'm going to kill that guy.

00:00:20.645 --> 00:00:23.398
Don't laugh!
I even dressed up like this for you--

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:29.195
Stop it! I don't want to fight you.

00:00:30.405 --> 00:00:32.323
Stop, stop!

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:48.465
You little...

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:52.552
What's wrong?
Can't fight for real against a girl?

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:56.389
I've never considered you a girl
even once!

00:01:00.101 --> 00:01:03.188
-Stop it!
-Use your knife, Caiman.

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:08.068
You're more impressive with a knife!

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:17.327
Why, Nikaido?

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:20.997
En's enemies are my enemies.

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:25.376
That's enough bullshit from you.

00:01:27.837 --> 00:01:30.006
Wake the hell up!

00:01:38.681 --> 00:01:40.350
Hey, let's call it quits.

